 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "RoadwaySpeedTracker() starts with no reports. addReport(start, end, speed) adds a report covering every integer point p with start <= p < end. removeReport(start, end, speed) removes one live report with exactly these three values and returns true, or returns false and changes nothing when there is none. getAverageSpeed(point) returns the arithmetic mean of the speeds of the live reports covering point as a floating-point number (sum / count, correctly rounded), or -1.0 when no live report covers it. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
